Package: relay-daemon
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Felag Engineering
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Replaces: relay-read
Conflicts: relay-read
Homepage: https://github.com/Felag-Engineering/relay
Description: Relay relay-daemon, the privileged fleet-administration Node daemon.
 Enforces the Node's locally rooted Policy and runs the Operations it allows.
 The package installs the daemon and its hardened unit and never starts it.
